      {
        "id": 222310,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-20T19:20:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint at 10/15/0.&nbsp; I went in mostly all guns blazing on Steel, though on turn 1 I had Expat sacrifice Pride to Ray Manta and on turn 2 Chrono Ranger took 2 potshots at him to get him into snipe territory.&nbsp; I also had the first bit of Hunter Tech take the first sniper shot so I could have Chrono draw with Kill on Sight.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Other moves I made include putting two things in the omni-cannon to nuke the enticing target, having Expat hairiside when Grazer threw out way too much tech, and putting every net on Plinkmaster Chrono.&nbsp; Eventually though, it was a whisky crazed big man that took down ol-amby.</p>",
