        "created_at": "2018-09-20T21:08:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I also got a Mint without dealing with agents. Instead I just burned Steel like everyone else, and let Greazer kill Expatriette. Ended with Bunker at 1, and Chrono-Ranger at 3 (in my practice game, I ended with Bunker at 1 and Chron-Ranger at 2).</p>",
