      {
        "id": 222315,
        "name": "dmiitrie",
        "username": "dmiitrie",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-22T19:28:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near Mint. My biggest mistake in the first game was not taking out Espionagent with Whole Gang first turn. &nbsp;Sure, he comes back from Battle Medic, but after Hold the Line is gone, he’s easy enough to get rid of again, then Matt Hayes can start picking off agents with impunity. &nbsp;Once I corrected that in the 2nd game, things went a lot more smoothly. &nbsp;</p>",
