      {
        "id": 222316,
        "name": "Griff's Dad",
        "username": "Griff_s_Dad",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-25T15:00:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ouch. A fine, because of bad planning on my part.</p>\n<p>Often with Greazer, I try to do a damage race and take him down before he takes his target down. Wrong strategy for this game. You have to let Expatriette die. It took me two games to figure that out.</p>\n<p>The third game, I was slow getting rid of the agents, because I didn't use The Whole Gang. I ended up getting Steel down and then Ambuscade to single digits before he healed off of doubleteams and took me down.</p>\n<p>Finally the fourth game I triumphed, but by then I just wanted to be done.</p>",
        "post_number": 31,
